========================================
SERVICE: NOTIFICATION SERVICE
========================================

PURPOSE:
Handles sending notifications for order updates, payments, etc.

----------------------------------------
CORE RESPONSIBILITIES:
----------------------------------------
- Listen to Kafka events
- Send notifications (email/SMS - simulated)
- Log notifications

----------------------------------------
EVENTS HANDLED:
----------------------------------------
- payment-success
- payment-failed
- order-created

----------------------------------------
DATABASE:
----------------------------------------

TABLE: notification
- id
- message
- type
- created_at

----------------------------------------
SUMMARY:
----------------------------------------
Notification Service consumes Kafka events and sends async notifications.